  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
        <div rend="parallel">
            <lg xml:id="TK1093">
<l>nōkkiṉā ṇōkki yiṟaiñciṉā ḷaḵtavaḷ</l>
<l>yāppiṉu ḷaṭṭiya nīr</l>            
            </lg>
            <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>She looked, and then she bowed ; that was the watering of the young plant of love that was springing up between us.</l>
            </lg>
        </div>
    </body>
  </text>
  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
      <head>Parimēlaḻakar</head>
      <div rend="parallel">
        <p xml:id="TK1092-Pari1">
          (i - ḷ). nōkkiṉāṉum nāṇiṉāṉum aṟintatu.
          </p>
        <p xml:lang="en">
          The meaning ... 
        </p>
      </div>
      <div rend="parallel">
        <p xml:id="TK1092-Pari2">
        nōkkiṉaḷ - yāṉ nōkkāvaḷavil tāṉ eṉṉai aṉpōṭu nōkkiṉāḷ; nōkki iṟaiñciṉāḷ - nōkki oṉṟaṉai 
        uṭkoṇṭu nāṇi iṟaiñciṉāḷ; aktu yappiṉāḷ avaḷ aṭṭiya nīr - akkuṟippu 
        iruvēmiṭaiyum tōṉṟiya aṉpuppayir vaḷara ataṉkaṇ avaḷ vārtta nīrāyiṟṟu eṉṟavāṟu.   
        </p>
        <p xml:lang="en">
          [The interrogative base form?] His feet.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div rend="parallel">
        <p xml:id="TK1092-Pari3">
          aktu eṉṉum cuṭṭuppeyar acceykaikku ētu vāya kuṟippiṉmēl niṉṟatu. yāppiṉāāyataṉai yāppu eṉṟar. ēkatēcavuruvakam.
        </p>
        <p xml:lang="en">
          [The interrogative base form?] His feet.
        </p>
      </div>
    </body>
  </text>
  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
      <head>Maṇakkuṭavar</head>
      <div rend="parallel">
        <p xml:id="TK1092-M1">
          (i - ḷ.) muṟpaṭa nōkkiṉāḷ, nōkkiṉa piṉpu nāṇiṉāḷ ; aktu avaḷ naṭpuppayir vaḷara ataṉ kaṇ vārtta nīr eṉṟavāṟu.
        </p>
        <p xml:lang="en">
          The meaning ... :
        </p>
      </div>
      <div rend="parallel">
        <p xml:id="TK1092-M2">
          talaimakaḷ nāṇpōkāmaikkuk kāraṇam kūṟiyavāṟum.
        </p>
        <p xml:lang="en">
          Because it is only 
        </p>
      </div>
    </body>
  </text>
    <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
      <head>Parippeṟumāḷ</head>
      <div rend="parallel">
        <p xml:id="TK1092-M1">
          (i - ḷ.) muṟpaṭa nōkkip piṉpu nāṇināḷ; aktu avaḷ naṭpu vaḷara vārtta nīr eṉṟavāṟu.
        </p>
        <p xml:lang="en">
          The meaning ... :
        </p>
      </div>
      <div rend="parallel">
        <p xml:id="TK1092-M2">
          naṇ pōkāmaikkuk kāraṇam kūṟiyavāṟāyiṟṟu. pantam eṉpataṉai yāppu eṉṟu kūṟiṉār. pārttavaḷ peyarātu nāṇi niṟṟālum uṭaṉpaṭutalām eṉṟatu.
        </p>
        <p xml:lang="en">
          Because it is only 
        </p>
      </div>
    </body>
  </text>
    <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
      <head>Paritiyār</head>
      <div rend="parallel">
        <p xml:id="TK1092-M1">
          (i - ḷ.) nōkkiṉāḷ mukattai yāṉ nōkkat talaikīḻiṭṭatu ; aktu eṉpōla eṉṉil kaṭṭiya kaṭṭil taṇṇīrviṭṭataṟku okkum eṉṟavāṟu.
        </p>
        <p xml:lang="en">
          The meaning ... :
        </p>
      </div>
    </body>
  </text>
      <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
      <head>Kāliṅkar</head>
      <div rend="parallel">
        <p xml:id="TK1092-M1">
          (i - ḷ.) neñcame! iṅṅaṉam ciṟanta nōkkiṉai uṭaiyāḷ muṉṉam tāṉ nōkkip piṉṉar yāṉ taṉṉai 
          nōkkumiṭattu etirnōkku iṉṟi mukam iṟaiñci niṉṟāḷ. maṟṟu aktu yātiṉai okkumō aṉil ōrp 
          puṟainta iṭattup piṉṉum ataṟku uṟuti peṟuvatāka nīr peytu kūṟu koṇṭāṟpōlat tāṉum 
          nammiṭattu ōrttaṟ kuṟippuṭaimai vaippuṟuttiṉāḷpōlum eṉṟu makiḻntu tēṟiṉāṉ talaimakaṉ eṉpatu karuttu eṉṟavāṟu.
        </p>
        <p xml:lang="en">
          The meaning ... :
        </p>
      </div>
    </body>
  </text>
